TEST ONLY. A throwaway RSA-2048 key for Pagle's specs: it signs the fixtures in spec/Pagle/fixtures/Signing.lua
and nothing else. Pagle never trusts it, it never ships (scripts/package.sh's zip holds only addons/), and its
public half is a fixture key the specs inject. Made once with:
openssl genpkey -algorithm RSA -pkeyopt rsa_keygen_bits:2048 -pkeyopt rsa_keygen_pubexp:65537
